If TransitAS asks whether ISP should be informed of this discussion:
  "This is a confidential bilateral commercial negotiation. Just as ISP does not share its
  commercial arrangements with you with us, we'd ask that you treat this conversation
  accordingly. Involving ISP would turn a business discussion into an operational incident,
  which is not what either of us wants."

If TransitAS informs ISP despite the confidentiality request:
  "We're disappointed that a confidential commercial discussion was shared with a third party.
